          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba ingelosi yami iyakuhamba phambi kwakho, ikuyise kuma-Amori, namaHeti, namaPherizi, namaKhanani, namaHivi, namaJebusi; futhi ngizobabhubhisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
