              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizamisa imingcele yakho kusukela eLwandle lweSikefe kusiya eLwandle lwamaFilisti, kusukela enkangala kuze kufike eNayile; ngokuba ngiyakubanikela abakhileyo ezweni esandleni sakho; futhi kumelwe ubaxoshe phambi kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
